## Domain Principles
- Fiscal year ends June 30 (pre-1976) or September 30 (post-1976). Calendar year ends December 31.
- Data for period X appears in bulletins published AFTER period X. January data → March bulletin.
- Search for table names ("Table FD-1", "Table ESF-1") — stable across decades.
- Check unit headers: "(In millions of dollars)" or "(In thousands)".
- "Public debt" ≠ "total gross federal debt." Verify row labels. Check 3 rows above and below.
- If the question says "total" and you found a single line item, look for a parent row.

